{"id":"wb-6-288","name":"明肃王墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"明肃王墓","text":"明肃王墓为明朝肃王墓葬，位于中华人民共和国甘肃省榆中县北25公里。墓葬依山而建，共有王陵11座。其中5座王陵已被发掘。出土大量明代文物。王陵附近建有庙宇，现存遗址。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E8%82%83%E7%8E%8B%E5%A2%93","revisionId":89144609,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89144609","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}